  "rhoillyg-orchard": {
    "_review": "MIS-EXTRACTED. improvements.js glued each header onto the end of the preceding row ('An herbalist of considerable skill and patience And either of these, to germinate the seeds:'), and the outcome prose onto the last requirement. The real structure is: both (seeds, herbalist) / either of these (experimentation, advice) / each of these (spring, pulling together, protecting). Modelled here as all-of pending the extractor fix.",
    "requires": {
      "all": [
        "sack-full",
        "herbalist-considerable",
        {
          "any": 1,
          "of": [
